00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:05.780
and payout ratios below 60%.

00:02:05.780 --> 00:02:09.980
Then size positions at 3% to 5% of TFSA capital.

00:02:10.420 --> 00:02:12.600
This approach historically outperforms

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:15.020
in late cycle environments when rates stabilize

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:17.420
because the yield provides a buffer

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:19.300
